doctype html
html(lang="zh-Hant-TW")
  head
    meta(charset="utf-8")
    meta(name="viewport",content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1")
    title lotion interactive
    link(rel="preconnect",href="https://fonts.gstatic.com")
    +css([
      {url: "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap"},
      {name: "lotion", version: "dev", path: "index.css"}
    ])
    style(type="text/css")
      include:stylus ../index.styl
      include:stylus scene.styl
    script(type="text/markdown",class="lotion-doc",lang="zh").
      ---
      lotion: 1
      title: 推雲過山
      summary: lotion 互動示範：按鈕、拖動、滑桿、倒轉與慢動作。
      lang: zh-TW
      kind: linear
      duration: 12
      ---

      ## 推雲 {t=0-5}

      - show: 雲從左邊飄向山。1–4 秒出現「叮」按鈕，點了發出一聲提示音，不影響播放。
      - note: 播到 5 秒時，4.5–5 秒循環播放 ( 雲在山前顫動 )，等讀者把雲拖過山頂；拖過去後從 5 秒繼續。

      ## 下沉 {t=5-12}

      - show: 雲翻過山往右下沉，右下角顯示山後的溫度。
      - note: 右上的滑桿調整山高 ( 1000–3000 公尺 )，溫度依山高改變：山後溫度 = 20 + 山高 × 0.4 °C/100 m。
      - note: 「倒轉」從目前位置倒著播回開頭，「慢動作」切換 0.5 倍速。長按山會顯示說明。
    script(type="text/markdown",class="lotion-doc",lang="en").
      ---
      lotion: 1
      title: Push the cloud over the mountain
      summary: A lotion interaction demo: a button, dragging, a slider, rewind and slow motion.
      lang: en
      kind: linear
      duration: 12
      ---

      ## Push {t=0-5}

      - show: a cloud drifts toward the mountain. From 1 to 4 s a "ding" button plays a short tone without touching playback.
      - note: at 5 s, 4.5 - 5 s loops ( the cloud trembles before the mountain ) until the reader drags it over the peak; then it plays on from 5 s.

      ## Descend {t=5-12}

      - show: the cloud sinks down the far side; the temperature behind the mountain shows at the bottom right.
      - note: the slider sets the mountain height ( 1000 - 3000 m ); temperature behind = 20 + height × 0.4 °C / 100 m.
      - note: "Rewind" plays backward to the start, "Slow" toggles half speed. Long-press the mountain for a note.
  body
    .wrap
      h1 lotion interactive
      p.
        互動作品的示範：畫面是 <code>seek(t, state)</code>，狀態由讀者的操作改變。
        <a href="?lang=en">English</a> · <a href="?lang=zh">中文</a>
      #demo.demo
      p.hint 點畫面空白處播放 / 暫停；按鈕、雲、滑桿、山是可互動元素 ( <code>.lotion-hit</code> )，點它們不會切換播放。
      p.hint.log
    +script([{name: "lotion", version: "dev", path: "index.js", defer: false}])
    script(type="text/javascript")
      include:lsc scene.ls
